{
  "name": "ReadIntoIsADict",
  "comment": "A format type owns its parse (ruling 5): the first read into a json file parses it\ninto a plang dict, not a JsonElement carrier. The developer-visible proof: `%cfg% is dict`\nis true, so the dict operator sees it as a dict (Cut2 / Narrow baseline is red today\nbecause parsed json is a C# JsonElement, not a plang value).",
  "step": [
